'''Speeder Sales''' was a business at the [[Orondia Refueling Station]] during the [[Clone Wars]],<ref name="Friends" /> and [[Horizon Base]] during the [[Galactic Civil War]].<ref name="Forgotten" /> The advertisement was [[Color|green]] and black and featured the business' logo next to a [[speeder bike]].<ref name="Friends" /> Decades later, the business' logo was used in a [[Speeder Sales (poster)|decorative poster]] in [[Torra Doza]]'s [[Torra's Quarters|quarters]] at another refueling station, the ''[[Colossus]]''. It showed a person posing in front of a similar speeder bike, accompanied by the business' logo.<ref name="Tower">{{Resistance|The High Tower}}</ref> In addition, an advertisement for the company was seen on the exterior of [[Vranki's Hotel and Casino]], a [[space station]] in the [[Voxx Cluster]].<ref name="Voxx">{{Resistance|The Voxx Vortex 5000}}</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
{{Quote|Signage at the fueling station includes: Eat at Koe's, Bounty Emporium: Always Open, Bounty Never Sleeps; Security Services; Speeder Sales; The Pilot's Lounge (Live Band Every Night); Craft Repair and Maintenance; Repair Rack Droid Services; Orondia Tours; and Meteor Cafe|StarWars.com Trivia Gallery for "Friends and Enemies"|<ref name="Trivia">{{SW|url=series/clone-wars/friends-and-enemies-trivia-gallery|text="Friends and Enemies" Trivia Gallery}} {{C|Slide 11}}</ref>}}
Craft Repair and Maintenance was first mentioned in an advertisement at the [[Orondia Refueling Station]] in the ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]'' episode "[[Friends and Enemies]]."<ref name="Friends" />

